{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026Ar7uuhgb7d1793099763.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>水務署於筲箕灣東大街電車總站附近設服務站，向市民派樽裝水，亦有水箱和水車供市民取水。現場仍有逾百箱樽裝水儲備，水務署派員及關愛隊分發樽裝水予市民。排隊領取樽裝水的市民已較稍早前減少。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_LIVE.BURST.BARRY 1900_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026YWMG0F1Jmp1793100164.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T12:42:08.161971+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":91,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T11:11:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T16:38:22.820479+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T12:38:23.923530+00:00","content_hash":"04f329f977c8f865c81379a8759ab1ca9b8e2cf7d0bc422b188902180f370d8b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}